        <mxCell id="decisions-box" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;arcSize=8;" value="Key Architecture Decisions:&#xa;&#xa;1. Micro-Frontend Pattern: Webpack Module Federation&#xa;   • Independent deployment per entity&#xa;   • Shared runtime dependencies&#xa;   • Dynamic loading&#xa;&#xa;2. Communication: Event Bus + Shared State&#xa;   • Loose coupling between MFEs&#xa;   • Centralized state for auth/config&#xa;&#xa;3. Routing: Shell-level with MFE sub-routing&#xa;   • /grip/*, /addi/*, /[entity]/*&#xa;   • Entity detection from URL or user context&#xa;&#xa;4. Styling: CSS-in-JS + Theme Provider&#xa;   • Entity-specific theme injection&#xa;   • CSS variable overrides&#xa;&#xa;5. Build &amp;amp; Deploy: Independent CI/CD pipelines&#xa;   • Shell and each MFE deployed separately&#xa;   • Version management via MFE registry&#xa;&#xa;6. Entity Onboarding: Configuration-driven&#xa;   • Add entity config JSON&#xa;   • Deploy new MFE to CDN&#xa;   • Register in MFE registry" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="480" width="400" x="1680" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tech-stack-box" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;arcSize=8;" value="Recommended Tech Stack:&#xa;&#xa;Shell Container:&#xa;• React 18+ or Vue 3&#xa;• Webpack 5 Module Federation&#xa;• React Router / Vue Router&#xa;• Styled Components / Emotion&#xa;&#xa;State Management:&#xa;• Redux Toolkit or Zustand&#xa;• React Query for data fetching&#xa;&#xa;Micro-Frontends:&#xa;• React/Vue (per entity choice)&#xa;• Independent package.json&#xa;• Shared component library&#xa;&#xa;Build &amp;amp; Deploy:&#xa;• Webpack 5&#xa;• Azure Static Web Apps / CDN&#xa;• GitHub Actions CI/CD&#xa;&#xa;Monitoring:&#xa;• Application Insights&#xa;• Sentry for error tracking&#xa;• Web Vitals metrics" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="480" width="400" x="1680" y="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
